{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Anacreonsystems/ariadne/pulls/14","id":5159876154,"node_id":"PR_kwDOVPYX_s8AAAABM412Og","html_url":"https://github.com/Anacreonsystems/ariadne/pull/14","diff_url":"https://github.com/Anacreonsystems/ariadne/pull/14.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Anacreonsystems/ariadne/pull/14.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Anacreonsystems/ariadne/issues/14","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Anacreonsystems/ariadne/pulls/14/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Anacreonsystems/ariadne/pulls/14/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Anacreonsystems/ariadne/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Anacreonsystems/ariadne/issues/14/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Anacreonsystems/ariadne/statuses/aa131ce5868482d1f98a77a8c1a340ec5e59c9a9","number":14,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Cancel graph work when leaving FlowRun pages","user":{"login":"7architect","id":33001830,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMDAxODMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33001830?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/7architect","html_url":"https://github.com/7architect","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/7architect/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/7architect/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/7architect/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/7architect/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/7architect/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/7architect/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/7architect/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/7architect/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/7architect/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Leaving a FlowRun page could let queued layout, late event responses or texture work access destroyed Pixi objects. Graph callbacks now belong to their containers and application generation: teardown cancels throttles, removes subscriptions, rejects stale results and releases late resources. Application initialization publishes only the current completed owner, including stop/start races.\n\nThe real browser probe now collects errors through context/browser closure before writing its verdict. An injected late error proves the gate exits unsuccessfully.\n\nValidation completed: 36 lifecycle regressions using actual Pixi containers/Sprites, real throttles and controlled asynchronous boundaries; 134 affected tests; 33 browser/accessibility cases; three fresh packaged eight-document PostgreSQL/ProcessWorker observations with zero post-close page errors; exact served bundle checks; TypeScript, lint, formatting and production build. The full local UI suite is pending a controlled idle-CPU rerun after two one-second waits expired during competing build/lint/browser work; the unchanged failing file passes all nine cases in isolation. Hosted UI/static/CodeQL acceptance is also pending.\n\nThe native runtime was merged in #13 after 102 successful checks and five conditional skips, with 570 PostgreSQL 17 and 107 SQLite native passes, zero skips. Every Python/configuration/test blob remains identical; this follow-up is UI-only. ADR-0039–0041 remain in progress until the final gates and source-bound review close.\n\n[Lifecycle decision and acceptance](https://github.com/Anacreonsystems/ariadne/blob/native-stream-storage/architecture/streaming-etl/adr/ADR-0041-owned-graph-lifecycle-during-navigation.md)\n","labels":[{"id":12960225771,"node_id":"LA_kwDOVPYX_s8AAAADBH1Z6w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Anacreonsystems/ariadne/labels/ui","name":"ui","description":null,"color":"ededed","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-04T18: